ily: &quot;Gamja Flower&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Poor Story&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-size: 28px !important;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px !important;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Black Han Sans&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Poor Story&quot; !important;\"><font face=\"Yeon Sung\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Gamja Flower&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Hi Melody&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Single Day&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Poor Story&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Yeon Sung&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gaegu !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: Sunflower !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Single Day&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Hi Melody&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Poor Story&quot; !important;\">-오전 7시: 기상</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></font><div><font face=\"Yeon Sung\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Gamja Flower&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Hi Melody&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Single Day&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Poor Story&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Yeon Sung&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gaegu !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: Sunflower !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Single Day&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Hi Melody&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Poor Story&quot; !important;\">-오전 7시 10분: 세안</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></font></div><div><font face=\"Yeon Sung\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Gamja Flower&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Hi Melody&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Single Day&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Poor Story&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Yeon Sung&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gaegu !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: Sunflower !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Single Day&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Hi Melody&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Poor Story&quot; !important;\">-오전 8시: 아침 식사, 약 복용 후 양치질</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></font></div><div><font face=\"Yeon Sung\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Gamja Flower&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Hi Melody&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Single Day&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Poor Story&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Yeon Sung&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gaegu !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: Sunflower !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Single Day&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Hi Melody&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Poor Story&quot; !important;\">식사를 할때는 제대로 식기를 사용하도록 해요. \n식기가 여러개라면 바깥쪽부터 사용하고. 잘 할 수 있잖아요, 네?</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></font></div><div><font face=\"Yeon Sung\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Gamja Flower&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Hi Melody&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Single Day&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Poor Story&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Yeon Sung&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gaegu !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: Sunflower !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Single Day&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Hi Melody&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Poor Story&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: line-through !important;\">-오후 1시: 점심 식사, 이후 양치질&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></font></div><div><font face=\"Yeon Sung\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Gamja Flower&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Hi Melody&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Single Day&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Poor Story&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Yeon Sung&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gaegu !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: Sunflower !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Single Day&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Hi Melody&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Poor Story&quot; !important;\">억지로 먹지 않아도 좋아요. 그래도 점심을 먹는다면 좋을텐데.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></font></div><div><font face=\"Yeon Sung\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Gamja Flower&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Hi Melody&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Single Day&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Poor Story&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Yeon Sung&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gaegu !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: Sunflower !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Single Day&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Hi Melody&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Poor Story&quot; !important;\">-오후 6시: 저녁 식사, 약 복용 후 양치질</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></font></div><div><font face=\"Yeon Sung\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Gamja Flower&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Hi Melody&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Single Day&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Poor Story&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Yeon Sung&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gaegu !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: Sunflower !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Single Day&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Hi Melody&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Poor Story&quot; !important;\">아침식사와 저녁식사는 되도록이면 메뉴를 다르게 해서 먹도록 합시다.\n그리고 밀라, 밤 9시쯤에 목욕하게 하는 편이 좋지 않을까요?</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></font></div><div><font face=\"Yeon Sung\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Gamja Flower&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Hi Melody&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Single Day&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Poor Story&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Yeon Sung&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gaegu !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: Sunflower !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Single Day&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Hi Melody&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Poor Story&quot; !important;\">-오후 10시: 약 복용 후 취침</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></font></div><div><font face=\"Yeon Sung\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"Yeon Sung\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Gamja Flower&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Hi Melody&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Single Day&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Poor Story&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Yeon Sung&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gaegu !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: Sunflower !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Single Day&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Hi Melody&quot; !important;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Poor Story&quot; !important;\">&nbsp;+최소한 이것들은 지키면서 사세요.\n그리고 이 앞장에 적어둔 내용 말인데요, 한 번 읽어보시고, 남들이 보지 못하게 찢어서 먹어버리세요. 그리고 꼭 <span style=\"font-weight: bold !important;\">기억</span>해야해요. 알았죠?</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></font></div></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><div><font face=\"Yeon Sung\"></font></div></span></span><div><font face=\"Yeon Sung\"></font></div></span><div><font face=\"Yeon Sung\"></font></div></span><div><font face=\"Yeon Sung\"></font></div></span><div><font face=\"Yeon Sung\"></font></div></span></span><div><font face=\"Yeon Sung\"></font></div></span></span><div><font face=\"Yeon Sung\"></font></div></span><div><font face=\"Yeon Sung\"></font></div></span></span></span></span></span><div><font face=\"Yeon Sung\"></font></div></span></span></span><div><font face=\"Yeon Sung\"></font></div></span></span></span></span><div><font face=\"Yeon Sung\"></font></div></span></span></span></span><div><font face=\"Yeon Sung\"></font></div></span><div><font face=\"Yeon Sung\"> </font></div>",
